      "id": "claim_2e61c383fa4f41918f1232fdda2ffc94",
      "statement": "HighlightProvider's highlightElement(id, type) matches trace links per DisplayOption: traceLink.sentenceNumber for DOCUMENTATION, traceLink.modelElementId for ARCHITECTURE_MODEL, and traceLink.codeElementId for CODE_MODEL, using loose equality so the id argument may be a number (sentence identifiers) or a string (element ids) interchangeably.",
